poppler_ccitt
=============

Lightweight standalone CCITT Group 3 (1D/2D) and Group 4 (T.6) fax decoder
extracted from upstream Poppler (originally Xpdf):

- `Stream-CCITT.h`: verbatim from `poppler/Stream-CCITT.h`
- `poppler_ccitt.cpp`: `CCITTFaxStream` from `poppler/Stream.cc`, adapted to
  operate directly on in-memory `std::vector<unsigned char>` buffers without
  pulling in Poppler's full object/stream tree.

